  "version": "0.5.4-beta.1",
  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.5.3`\n\n### Fixes\n\n- close a tab's pooled SFTP connections when the tab closes, which kept the SSH connection and the server's sshd open for good, and reap idle connections every minute without closing one a transfer is still using, which an expiry triggered by another tab's connection used to cut off mid-way ([26648c7a](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/26648c7aa9b3f0a097c146eda05e011d0d767a60))\n- hold back only the start of a color query in SSH output instead of every unterminated OSC sequence, which kept everything after a truncated title or a binary cat off the screen until a stray BEL arrived, and copied and rescanned a large inline image or OSC 52 clipboard on every packet, taking four seconds for two megabytes ([77740a8d](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/77740a8db50f65d8b2b7fee767a58b15cef5a984))\n\n### Performance\n\n- try WebGL again thirty seconds after a terminal loses its context, up to three times, instead of keeping a terminal that stays in sight on the canvas fallback, which keeps four full-size layers ([705392e3](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/705392e3c18d6e8e27feee410b783d089a6958dc))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.5.3...v0.5.4-beta.1](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.5.3...v0.5.4-beta.1)",
